00:01:35.000 --> 00:02:17.000
space consisting of play areas, tennis courts, and grassy lawns. By the year 2000, the Miyazawa's property was one of only four remaining houses that were essentially located inside the parklands. Soshigaya Park was situated along the east and south side of the house, with the Senkawa River to the west. Directly behind and separated only by a fence was a skate park and playground. The area was typically quiet and safe, but the addition of the skate park had introduced a hive of activity and lots of noise.
空间，由游乐区、网球场和草坪组成。到2000年，宫泽家的房产是仅存的四栋实际上位于公园内的房屋之一。祖师谷公园位于房屋的东侧和南侧，西侧则是仙川河流。直接在房屋后方且仅隔一道栅栏的是一个滑板公园和游乐场。该地区通常安静而安全，但滑板公园的加入带来了一个活动中心和大量的噪音。

