Mikio and Yasuko had met at a self-development seminar during the 1980s, eventually going on to marry in December of 1986. 44-year-old Mikio was a creative man with a love for animation. His childhood was spent participating in puppetry and other theatrical productions at school. After graduating from university, he worked as an animator and question developer for quiz programs. He eventually secured a position at Interbrand, a London-based marketing company with over 20 officers worldwide.
干男和泰子在20世纪80年代的一次自我发展研讨会上相遇，并最终于1986年12月结婚。44岁的干男是一个热爱动画的富有创造力的人。他的童年是在学校参与木偶戏和其他戏剧制作中度过的。大学毕业后，他做过动画师和问答节目的问题开发人员。他最终在Interbrand获得了一个职位，该公司是一家总部位于伦敦的营销公司，在世界各地拥有20多家办事处。

