laundry were located. On the mezzanine level, a pull-down ladder granted access to the third floor attic, which contained Mikio and Yasuko's bedroom. At the base of the ground floor stairs, Haruko discovered the blood-soaked body of her son-in-law, Mikio. She continued upstairs to the mezzanine level, where, on the landing, she found the bodies of her daughter Yasuko and granddaughter Nina. They too were lying in pools of blood.
洗衣房都在那里。在夹层，一个可拉下的梯子可以通往三楼的阁楼，里面有干男和泰子的卧室。在一楼楼梯底部，春子发现了她的女婿干男那血迹斑斑的尸体。她继续上楼来到夹层，在平台上，她发现了她的女儿泰子和孙女妮娜的尸体。她们也躺在血泊中。

12
00:08:19.000 --> 00:09:03.000
Haruko touched them to check if they were still alive, but both were cold. In a state of shock, she rushed out of the house and called the police. Attending officers found the body of Rei Miyazawa in the bunk bed he shared with his sister. Investigators pieced together a probable series of events based on the presentation of the crime scene. It appeared as though the killer had climbed the fence at the rear of the property and scaled up to the mezzanine level. A screen that covered the bathroom window had been removed, indicating the killer had done
春子摸了摸她们，想看看她们是否还活着，但两人都已经冰凉。处于震惊状态中的她冲出屋子，报了警。赶到的警员在礼·宫泽与姐姐共用的双层床上发现了他的尸体。调查人员根据犯罪现场的呈现，拼凑出了一系列可能的事发经过。凶手似乎翻越了房产后方的栅栏，爬到了夹层。覆盖浴室窗户的纱窗被拆除了，这表明凶手是这样做的

