00:09:03.000 --> 00:09:44.000
this to enter the house. After strangling six-year-old Rei in his bedroom, the killer then came across Nina and launched an attack. As Mikio was the only member of the household not dressed for bed, it was believed he was working in his study when he heard the disturbance and went upstairs to investigate. He then came face-to-face with the intruder, who brandished a 34-centimeter long knife with a 21-centimeter blade that was typically used for preparing sashimi, a Japanese delicacy of raw fish and meat.
进入房子的。在卧室里勒死六岁的礼之后，凶手接着遇到了妮娜并发起了袭击。由于干男是家里唯一一个没有换上睡衣的成员，人们认为他当时正在书房工作，听到动静后上楼查看。接着，他与闯入者正面遭遇，对方挥舞着一把34厘米长、刀刃长21厘米的刀，这通常用于制作刺身——一种日本生鱼和生肉的美食。

