statements and technological data. They determined that during the day of Saturday, December 30, the Miyazawa's went shopping in an arcade near Chitose Karasuyama Railway Station, approximately 1.6km north of their home. At around 6pm, they were seen at another shopping centre near Sayijo Gakuenmae Railway Station, 1.8km south of their home. The Miyazawa's arrived home just before 7pm. Yasuko used the home telephone to call her mother before the family ate dinner together.
