stores. One of which was the Marufuru Corporation, where the crusher hat and raglan sweatshirt had also been purchased. Two plain black handkerchiefs belonging to the killer appeared to have been recently washed and ironed. Over the previous five years, a total of 66,500 matching handkerchiefs had been manufactured and sold by Japanese retail company Muji, which sells a variety of household and consumer goods.
其中一家是丸富公司，卷边帽和插肩袖运动衫也是在那里购买的。属于凶手的两块素黑手帕看起来像是最近刚洗过并熨烫过。在过去的五年里，日本零售公司无印良品（Muji）总共制造和售出了66,500块匹配的手帕，该公司销售各种家庭和消费品。

