throughout Japan. Two strands of black hair believed to belong to the killer were found in the bag. They had been intentionally cut rather than having fallen out naturally, with one measuring 2.5 cm and the other 1.5 mm. Also inside were stains from a fluorescent red dye that illuminated when highlighted with a UV light. Police had found a similar fluorescent agent inside the Miyazawa family's garage, yet the garage was locked on the night of the murders with no indication that the killer
包里发现了两根被认为是凶手的黑发。它们是被刻意剪断的，而不是自然脱落的，一根长2.5厘米，另一根长1.5毫米。里面还有荧光红染料的污渍，用紫外线照射时会发光。警察在宫泽一家的车库里发现了类似的荧光剂，然而车库在谋杀当晚是锁着的，没有迹象表明凶手

