00:38:44.000 --> 00:39:25.000
California, including near the Edwards Air Force Base in the southwestern Mojave Desert. Other grains were traced to Japan's Miura Peninsula, similar to the sand found in the jacket. Further remnants found in the hip bag were analyzed to reveal tiny glass spheres of barium titanate powder, which is used by skateboarders as a form of grip tape to prevent their feet from slipping off the board. Oils and compounds that had come from a perfume or aftershave were lifted from both the hip bag and handkerchiefs.
加利福尼亚州，包括西南部莫哈韦沙漠中的爱德华兹空军基地附近。其他沙粒被追溯到日本的三浦半岛，类似于夹克上发现的沙。在腰包中发现的进一步残留物经过分析，显现出微小的钛酸钡粉末玻璃球，滑板爱好者将其用作一种防滑带，以防止他们的脚从滑板上滑落。从腰包和手帕中都提取出了来自香水或须后水的油脂和化合物。

