00:45:46.000 --> 00:46:42.000
was Adriatic and Mediterranean South European. As the majority of interracial marriages between Japanese and European individuals had only occurred within the past couple of generations, experts believed that the killer was more likely to be continental Asian than Japanese, or that the interracial conception had only occurred in his mother or grandmother's generation. By December 2006, six years after the murder, a total of 140,000 police officers had been involved in the investigation in some capacity. 98 individuals were still under investigation, with police focusing on people who may have been financially motivated to commit the crime, as well as those who may have held a grudge against a member of the family.
是亚得里亚海和地中海南部欧洲人。由于日本和欧洲个人之间的跨种族婚姻大多只发生在过去的两代人中，专家认为凶手更有可能是大陆亚洲人而不是日本人，或者这种跨种族繁衍只发生在母亲或祖母这一代。截至2006年12月，即谋杀案发生六年之后，总共有14万名警察以各种身份参与了调查。仍有98人处于调查之中，警方重点关注那些可能出于经济动机犯罪的人，以及可能对家庭成员怀恨在心的人。

